	quest.1F1B608D4D4A6C19.quest_desc: [
		"Industrial Foregoing is built on plastic and machine frames. Everything starts with latex from trees."
		""
		"§eThe path:§r latex, then plastic, then the four machine frames. Each frame unlocks a new set of machines. Along the way you'll set up farms, mob grinders and eventually a laser drill that pulls ore out of thin air."
		""
		"Grab some logs to get going."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Find, mine or loot 16 x Oak Log and carry it in your inventory. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
